# The k6 build the load test runs (Story MOTIR-8538 · MOTIR-8677).
#
# Read by build.sh (which builds exactly this pair) and by the run command, which
# checks `k6 version` against it on the generator. Pinned only after one local
# build of this pair opened /api/workbench/stream on a local production build and
# saw its opening `watermark` frame through the extension's API (2026-10-15).
# xk6-sse v0.2.0 needs k6 v2 and Go 1.25; do not move one pin without the other.
K6_VERSION=v1.2.1
XK6_SSE_MODULE=github.com/phymbert/xk6-sse
XK6_SSE_VERSION=v0.1.12
